    <bpmn:process id="W_W4653" name="W4653. Catch-Weight &amp; Cut-to-Length Unit-Cost Computation (per Board-Foot / Meter / Kg)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Catch-weight/cut-to-length item setup; periodic unit-cost refresh
Frequency: Per setup + periodic
Volume: Lumber (board-foot), wire/cable (meter), pipes (meter), nails/bulk (kg), tiles (sq-m); sold at 600 POS
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Calibration (VS-115), DC Ops (VS-04), Pricing (VS-01.2)
Source: workflow W4653 — Catch-Weight &amp; Cut-to-Length Unit-Cost Computation (per Board-Foot / Meter / Kg)</bpmn:documentation>
