        <bpmn:outgoing>W4653_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4653_Task4" name="Compute the per-selling-unit cost for catch-weight/cut-to-length items from the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compute the per-selling-unit cost for catch-weight/cut-to-length items from the purchase unit cost and the conversion factor (e.g., cost per board-foot from per-cubic-meter lumber cost accounting for kerf/trim loss; cost per meter from per-roll wire cost; cost per kg from per-sack bulk cost) — validated against calibrated measurement (VS-115)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per setup + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4653_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4653_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4653_Task5" name="Account for fabrication yield/scrap (W169) and cutting labor where BuildRight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account for fabrication yield/scrap (W169) and cutting labor where BuildRight performs the cut (VS-09.1 custom fabrication); build the unit cost into the item master and the POS pricing
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Store Services
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4653_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4653_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4653_Task6" name="Periodically re-verify conversion factors and yield assumptions against actual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Periodically re-verify conversion factors and yield assumptions against actual cut/conversion data; adjust unit cost and post variance (W4659) where yield drifts
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4653_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
