      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Private-label product development (VS-41); cost-quote; periodic refresh
Frequency: Per PL SKU + periodic
Volume: Private-label assortment (VS-41); growing portfolio
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Private Label (VS-41), Procurement (VS-03), Insights/Should-cost (VS-44), Pricing (VS-01.2)
Source: workflow W4655 — Private-Label Fully-Burdened Cost Build (COGS+, Tooling, Royalty, MOQ)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4655_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4655_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
