        <bpmn:outgoing>W4655_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4655_Task4" name="Build the fully-burdened private-label cost: ex-works supplier cost +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the fully-burdened private-label cost: ex-works supplier cost + freight/duty/brokerage (W4651) + tooling/mold amortization (per unit over forecast volume) + quality-inspection cost + royalty/licence (if any) + minimum-order-quantity (MOQ) carrying cost
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Private Label
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per PL SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4655_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4655_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4655_Task5" name="Validate the PL cost vs. the national-brand equivalent cost and the target PL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Validate the PL cost vs. the national-brand equivalent cost and the target PL margin gap; surface tooling-amortization risk if volume underperforms forecast
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Insights
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per PL SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4655_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4655_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4655_Task6" name="Periodically re-roll PL cost on supplier-cost/material-index change (VS-106)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Periodically re-roll PL cost on supplier-cost/material-index change (VS-106); post PL-cost variance (W4658) and re-assess tooling amortization against actual volume
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4655_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
