    <bpmn:process id="W_W4656" name="W4656. Periodic Standard-Cost Roll, Revaluation &amp; WAC/Standard Reclass" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Standard-cost calendar (monthly/quarterly); material/FX/duty shift
Frequency: Periodic roll (monthly for volatile categories; quarterly standard)
Volume: ~35K active SKUs; full roll quarterly
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Controller, Merchandising (VS-01), Master Data (VS-29), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4656 — Periodic Standard-Cost Roll, Revaluation &amp; WAC/Standard Reclass</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4656_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4656_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4656_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4656_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4656_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4656_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4656_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4656_Start3" name="Standard-cost calendar (monthly/quarterly); material/FX/duty shift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4656_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4656_Task4" name="Run the periodic standard-cost roll: pull updated purchase-price (W4650)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Run the periodic standard-cost roll: pull updated purchase-price (W4650), landed cost (W4651), freight/handling (W4652), catch-weight (W4653), kit (W4654), PL (W4655); compute new standard cost per SKU per entity
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per roll</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4656_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4656_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4656_Task5" name="Post standard-cost revaluation: adjust on-hand inventory value to the new…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Post standard-cost revaluation: adjust on-hand inventory value to the new standard; post the revaluation to inventory and a cost-revaluation P&amp;L account; handle the WAC-at-receipt to standard reclass for items under WAC
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / GL
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per roll</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4656_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4656_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4656_Task6" name="Publish the new standard cost to merchandising/pricing (margin impact), approve…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Publish the new standard cost to merchandising/pricing (margin impact), approve via the change-control matrix (W4670), and archive the prior standard for variance analysis (W4657/W4658)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per roll</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4656_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4656_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4656_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4656_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-704 (ensure controlled execution — Standard-Cost Setup, Landed-Cost &amp; Item Cost Roll (PA-158.1).) | - CTL-704: standard roll Controller-approved; revaluation reconciled; prior standard archived for variance; change-controlled (W4670)
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4656_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4656_Annotation8" targetRef="W4656_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
